In the expanded gradient of the GRPO objective with $\widehat{A}_{i,t} = \widehat{A}_{i}$, the token-level factor multiplying $\nabla_{\theta} \log \pi_{\theta} (y_{i,t} | x, y_{i,<t})$ for each token $y_{i,t}$ is
